#: ../../infrastructure/servers/credentials.rst:64
msgid "Linking Credentials to Devices"
msgstr "Vinculación de credenciales a dispositivos"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/credentials.rst:66
msgid ""
"Credentials can be linked to infrastructure devices during server "
"creation or by editing an existing server:"
msgstr "Las credenciales pueden vincularse a dispositivos de infraestructura durante la creación del servidor o editando un servidor existente:"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/credentials.rst:68
msgid "Navigate to the server detail page or create a new server"
msgstr "Navegue a la página de detalle del servidor o cree un servidor nuevo"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/credentials.rst:69
msgid "In the Credentials section, select a stored credential from the dropdown"
msgstr "En la sección Credentials, seleccione una credencial almacenada del menú desplegable"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/credentials.rst:70
msgid "Save the configuration"
msgstr "Guarde la configuración"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/credentials.rst:72
msgid ""
"A single credential can be linked to multiple devices. When the "
"credential is updated, all linked devices will use the new value on their"
" next connection."
msgstr "Una sola credencial puede vincularse a varios dispositivos. Cuando se actualiza la credencial, todos los dispositivos vinculados usarán el nuevo valor en su próxima conexión."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/credentials.rst:74
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/credentials.rst:74
msgid ""
"When a credential store is configured with ``localCredentials: false``, "
"inline password entry is disabled and users must select a stored "
"credential."
msgstr "Cuando un almacén de credenciales está configurado con ``localCredentials: false``, la entrada de contraseña en línea está deshabilitada y los usuarios deben seleccionar una credencial almacenada."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/credentials.rst:77
msgid "Editing a Credential"
msgstr "Edición de una credencial"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/credentials.rst:80
msgid "Click the credential name or select :guilabel:`Edit` from the actions menu"
msgstr "Haga clic en el nombre de la credencial o seleccione :guilabel:`Edit` del menú de acciones"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/credentials.rst:81
msgid "Update the username, password, or other fields as needed"
msgstr "Actualice el nombre de usuario, la contraseña u otros campos según sea necesario"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/credentials.rst:84
msgid ""
"All devices linked to the updated credential will use the new values on "
"their next connection."
msgstr "Todos los dispositivos vinculados a la credencial actualizada usarán los nuevos valores en su próxima conexión."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/credentials.rst:87
msgid "Deleting a Credential"
msgstr "Eliminación de una credencial"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/credentials.rst:90
msgid "Select :guilabel:`Delete` from the actions menu"
msgstr "Seleccione :guilabel:`Delete` del menú de acciones"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/credentials.rst:91
msgid "Confirm deletion"
msgstr "Confirme la eliminación"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/credentials.rst:93
#: ../../infrastructure/servers/credentials.rst:106
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Advertencia"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/credentials.rst:93
msgid ""
"Deleting a credential removes all device links. Devices that relied on "
"this credential will no longer have stored access credentials until a new"
" credential is linked."
msgstr "Eliminar una credencial elimina todos los vínculos con dispositivos. Los dispositivos que dependían de esta credencial ya no tendrán credenciales de acceso almacenadas hasta que se vincule una credencial nueva."

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/credentials.rst:96
msgid "Credential Status"
msgstr "Estado de la credencial"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/credentials.rst:104
msgid "OK"
msgstr "OK"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/credentials.rst:105
msgid "Credential is healthy and accessible"
msgstr "La credencial está sana y accesible"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/credentials.rst:107
msgid "Some linked devices experienced issues (partial failure)"
msgstr "Algunos dispositivos vinculados experimentaron problemas (fallo parcial)"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/credentials.rst:108
msgid "Error"
msgstr "Error"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/credentials.rst:109
msgid "Credential access failed for all linked devices"
msgstr "El acceso a la credencial falló para todos los dispositivos vinculados"

#: ../../infrastructure/servers/credentials.rst:111
msgid ""
"A background job (``CypherBackedCredentialSyncRetryBackgroundJob``) "
"automatically retries failed credential operations for devices that were "
"unreachable during the last update."
msgstr "Un trabajo en segundo plano (``CypherBackedCredentialSyncRetryBackgroundJob``) reintenta automáticamente las operaciones de credenciales fallidas para dispositivos que no estuvieron accesibles durante la última actualización."

